{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is REGRET?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine a world where dictatorship and tyranny have triumphed. As one of the regime\u2019s traitors, you are sent to prison to take part in the &quot;Reintegration&quot; program.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/358766f4fe00a16c29dee6ddf8b0a3b2.avif?t=1768507619\" width=600 height=188 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE SETUP</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit down at a high-tech table with other participants. Different devices will appear in front of you \u2014 each with unique rules, explained by a professional narrator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/b0e76c306de503d029089e869f9741b5.poster.avif?t=1768507619\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/b0e76c306de503d029089e869f9741b5.webm?t=1768507619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/b0e76c306de503d029089e869f9741b5.mp4?t=1768507619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AN IMMERSIVE ATMOSPHERE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the oppressive world of totalitarian rule. Propaganda posters, authoritarian symbols, atmospheric locations, and an unforgettable sound design will pull you deep into the world of <strong>REGRET</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/48825a4d9343411730c3b1bfe48d7556.poster.avif?t=1768507619\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/48825a4d9343411730c3b1bfe48d7556.webm?t=1768507619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/48825a4d9343411730c3b1bfe48d7556.mp4?t=1768507619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CO-OP CONFRONTATION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s you<strong> versus</strong> the other victims of the regime. There\u2019s no fighting the system here, no chance to topple it \u2014 you\u2019ve already lost. Your only goal is simple: <strong>survive</strong>! Who will you team up with? Who can you trust? And how do you avoid being the last one left behind? Tension runs high until only <strong>one</strong> remains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/1a732a9cc995f56d8308743416fc6d30.poster.avif?t=1768507619\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/1a732a9cc995f56d8308743416fc6d30.webm?t=1768507619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/1a732a9cc995f56d8308743416fc6d30.mp4?t=1768507619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VARIETY OF GAMES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every round brings a new challenge, with more games added through updates. Enjoy a wide range of experiences with your friends \u2014 each designed to be unforgettable!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/0080e2d1e23e0256e82ba8d7227ff4fa.poster.avif?t=1768507619\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/0080e2d1e23e0256e82ba8d7227ff4fa.webm?t=1768507619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/0080e2d1e23e0256e82ba8d7227ff4fa.mp4?t=1768507619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DICTATORSHIP!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where life is scored, and your fate can be decided by the spin of a wheel, one question remains: what are you willing to do to survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/ac1b528e6ecb87b7d5e48683f1938a06.poster.avif?t=1768507619\" width=600 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/ac1b528e6ecb87b7d5e48683f1938a06.webm?t=1768507619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/ac1b528e6ecb87b7d5e48683f1938a06.mp4?t=1768507619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3589530?t=1768507619","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3589530?t=1768507619","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/bf2e1270d907e5cd8851a245b4e912b63348329d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768507619","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/bf2e1270d907e5cd8851a245b4e912b63348329d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768507619","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Commentary available","id":14},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4119060,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is REGRET?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine a world where dictatorship and tyranny have triumphed. As one of the regime\u2019s traitors, you are sent to prison to take part in the &quot;Reintegration&quot; program.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/358766f4fe00a16c29dee6ddf8b0a3b2.avif?t=1768507619\" width=600 height=188 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE SETUP</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit down at a high-tech table with other participants. Different devices will appear in front of you \u2014 each with unique rules, explained by a professional narrator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/b0e76c306de503d029089e869f9741b5.poster.avif?t=1768507619\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/b0e76c306de503d029089e869f9741b5.webm?t=1768507619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/b0e76c306de503d029089e869f9741b5.mp4?t=1768507619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AN IMMERSIVE ATMOSPHERE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the oppressive world of totalitarian rule. Propaganda posters, authoritarian symbols, atmospheric locations, and an unforgettable sound design will pull you deep into the world of <strong>REGRET</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/48825a4d9343411730c3b1bfe48d7556.poster.avif?t=1768507619\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/48825a4d9343411730c3b1bfe48d7556.webm?t=1768507619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/48825a4d9343411730c3b1bfe48d7556.mp4?t=1768507619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CO-OP CONFRONTATION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s you<strong> versus</strong> the other victims of the regime. There\u2019s no fighting the system here, no chance to topple it \u2014 you\u2019ve already lost. Your only goal is simple: <strong>survive</strong>! Who will you team up with? Who can you trust? And how do you avoid being the last one left behind? Tension runs high until only <strong>one</strong> remains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/1a732a9cc995f56d8